rodowisku przemysłowym: testy funkcji lokalizacji","otherTitles":[],"abstracts":[{"languageCode":"pol","content":"W artykule przedstawiono główne aspekty implementacji funkcji lokalizacji w systemie bezpieczeństwa, przeznaczonym do monitorowania pracownika, zwłaszcza w środowisku przemysłowym. Opisano strukturę systemu (w tym beacony Bluetooth, urządzenie osobiste i system nadrzędny) oraz techniki zastosowane do realizacji funkcji lokalizacji pracownika. Przedstawiono metodykę przeprowadzonych testów i ich wyniki wraz z interpretacją"}],"affiliations":[{"id":"5e709195878c28a04737f6d4","uid":"bkHqv4jUO-l_VdxfxJzbpww","uuid":"0eb0aa70-91ae-4f4e-86a8-55cc6d82d1d2","name":"Sieć Badawcza Łukasiewicz - Instytut Sztucznej Inteligencji i Cyberbezpieczeństwa","affiliatedPersonIDs":["5e7093f5878c28a0473b40a2","5ef2bcd37523404d1000ea73"],"parentId":"5e709195878c28a04737f6d4","parentUuid":"0eb0aa70-91ae-4f4e-86a8-55cc6d82d1d2","rootId":"5e709195878c28a04737f6d4","rootUuid":"0eb0aa70-91ae-4f4e-86a8-55cc6d82d1d2","type":"AUTHOR"}],"mainLanguage":"pol","mainLanguageName":"polski","pagesFromTo":"22-27","articleEvaluation":{"indexedJournal":false,"isReview":true,"wosConference":false},"contributionOrder":{"AUTHOR":["5ef2bcd37523404d1000ea73","5e7093f5878c28a0473b40a2"]},"journal":{"objectId":"61b9ac03ad204581b62ebb24","mniswId":"201199","title":"Bezpieczeństwo Pracy. Nauka i Praktyka","issn":"0137-7043","documentHash":"43952a31-7074-44c9-ab85-3b135a2b26bc"},"_version":4,"journalIssue":{"objectId":"6888b560fdbe8347cf0bce53","year":"2025","number":"3","documentHash":"49a2e156-ebc6-42af-971a-1cdde14dfc11"},"translation":false,"editors":[],"translators":[],"institutionProfile":true,"translationEditors":[],"keywords":[{"languageCode":"pol","keywords":["beacon","Bluetooth","lokalizacja","monitorowanie pracowników"]}],"lastRefresh":"1761905426255"},{"authors":[{"objectId":"68f9c1a5fdbe834ab5b0258e","name":"Artur","lastName":"Misztal","documentHash":"84537a30-2cdf-41e9-a232-0d60bdf3df74"}],"openAccess":{"textVersion":"FINAL_PUBLISHED","license":"CC_BY","releaseDate":"2025-10-22","releaseDateMode":"AT_PUBLICATION","mode":"OPEN_JOURNAL"},"objectId":"68f9c1a5fdbe834ab5b0258c","doi":"10.15439/2025f6805","publicUri":"https://annals-csis.org/Volume_43/drp/6805.html","type":"ARTICLE","typeName":"Artykuł","year":2025,"title":"DivCrypt: A Structured Framework for Validating Cryptographic Implementations","otherTitles":[],"abstracts":[{"languageCode":"eng","content":"This paper introduces the DivCrypt framework, a~step-by-step guidance for validation of cryptographic implementations. The core idea is to decompose the evaluated implementation into components across complexity layers and validate each component through a structured five-step process. DivCrypt is not intended to replace existing standards, but rather to serve as a practical audit playbook. It can be easily adopted by evaluators in formal certification processes, researchers conducting security audits, and developers performing internal testing. The framework is also intended to encourage creators of novel, non-standardized cryptographic constructs to publish and maintain DivCrypt-aligned knowledge base. Such contributions, including test vectors and known implementation vulnerabilities, would support not only the application of DivCrypt, but also benefit the broader research and development community."}],"affiliations":[{"id":"5e70918a878c28a04737de2d","uid":"bC-42HEo3GjCw621B3jcCSw","uuid":"919617f6-b49f-4075-b60b-465136e8dcb3","name":"Akademia Górniczo-Hutnicza im. Stanisława Staszica w Krakowie","affiliatedPersonIDs":["68f9c1a5fdbe834ab5b0258e"],"parentId":"5e70918a878c28a04737de2d","parentUuid":"919617f6-b49f-4075-b60b-465136e8dcb3","rootId":"5e70918a878c28a04737de2d","rootUuid":"919617f6-b49f-4075-b60b-465136e8dcb3","type":"AUTHOR"},{"id":"5e709195878c28a04737f6d4","uid":"bkHqv4jUO-l_VdxfxJzbpww","uuid":"0eb0aa70-91ae-4f4e-86a8-55cc6d82d1d2","name":"Sieć Badawcza Łukasiewicz - Instytut Sztucz